  "description": "Meet life-long single girl Bong Park and her friends. Bong Park knows something when it comes to romance, only in theory. Mihwa is a rich divorcee searching for a strong(?) man. Dalrae is a young mother who prefers hanging out with friends over her husband. Bong's best male friend Choi is often mistaken as a gay. Nothing unusual. They are among the people you know!\n\n[Official English Translation](https://www.netcomics.com/comic/isitjustme)",
